    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have a bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this piece of magic ammunition. The bonus is determined by the rarity of the ammunition. Once it successfully hits a target, the ammunition becomes a nonmagical piece of ammunition.</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.black-flag.rules.JournalEntry.PBo9j135EucIDliX.JournalEntryPage.8dnaDCJMMoaYpYkr inline]</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-9nHbWnSKvNAG8S2y\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Weapon (Any Ammunition), Rarity Varies, Price Varies</em></p><p>Create the final magic item by selection the appropriate mundane item and dragging an enchantment from the <q>Advancement &amp; Effects</q> tab to that item.</p></section>",
